# All committed validation data goes through Git LFS, regardless of extension
# (Coat .ascii, Polis .csv, MovieLens u.data, SNAP .gz, Community Notes .parquet).
# Git-ignored paths (validate/data/**/raw, archives, redundant extras) are never
# staged, so this only ever applies to the small committed slices.
validate/data/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
